# Normalize line endings to LF for all text files, in the repo and on
# checkout, regardless of the contributor's platform. Without this, Windows
# contributors (core.autocrlf=true by default) introduce CRLF diffs that
# pollute commits and conflict with the LF-based assertions in the test
# suite. See PR #52.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Raw zipsign public key — binary crypto material, never normalize or diff.
keys/*.pub binary
